WEBVTT

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.760
Don't miss that brightly shining light!

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:20.870
It's always there beside you.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:26.420
I'm sure the rest just depends on your perception.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:31.590
You don't have to search for it—just notice that it's there!

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:37.350
There's a tenderness that lies hidden behind the most common things:

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:43.230
a light that showers our days in color!

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:49.230
Tiny Days: This world is constructed...

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:54.800
Tiny Days: ...by fragments of miracles!

00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:00.180
Things that seemed meaningless

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:05.730
were actually protecting us, loving us, more than we ever knew.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:10.960
Tiny Heart: Our feelings flow forth...

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.000
Tiny Heart: ...as we give thanks for everything we've been given.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.490
We'll never, ever forget...

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:27.700
We'll cherish this feeling forevermore!

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:34.990
Let's Go to School

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:38.230
I'll be back!

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:40.610
I'm gonna be late!

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:43.490
She could've just set her charge timer.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:44.900
Is she an idiot?

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:49.240
I'm not quite sure, but I don't think
humans possess that function.

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:51.950
Well, whatever. It's all such a pain.

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:59.250
Hey, Base! You keep recharging like that
and you might end up becoming human.

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:02.850
Base?

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:04.300
Base, what's wrong?!

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.680
Base! Answer me!

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:10.600
What should we do, Gourai? Base isn't moving!

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:13.230
Stylet, isn't it possible that...

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:15.270
this isn't Base?

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:19.980
Whaaat?!

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:21.570
I didn't notice!

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.320
There's something written on it.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:27.180
"I'm going to school with Ao.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.990
Please don't look for us."

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:30.520
This is...

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.500
That idiot!

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:32.870
Girls' School
Wakaba Municipal

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:34.700
Good morning!

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:35.000
Girls' School
Wakaba Municipal

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:37.960
Oh, really?

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.680
So, like, I went to Meguro!

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:47.010
Base! What are you doing here?!

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:48.800
Where are Gourai and Sty-ko?

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:50.390
It's just me.

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.220
Ao? What's going on?

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.420
Ah, Bukiko! Good morning.

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:56.940
No, nothing's wrong!

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.350
For reals?

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:00.900
Hey, Bukiko, you do your homework?

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.610
Of course!

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:04.320
Can you let us see?

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:06.190
You guys, I swear!

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:07.450
Score!

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:12.280
Well, there's not much I can do now that you're here...

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:15.700
but you have to behave. No acting up, okay?

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:17.620
I <i>always</i> behave!

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:18.620
F.A. Girl!

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:22.420
You're heavy... You're <i>way</i> too heavy
for not even being equipped!

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:23.800
I'm sorry.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.840
You're designed for aerial battles, but my model is-

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:28.220
Fine, whatever.

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:32.180
But this is really gonna drain my battery!

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:34.970
What are we doing today?

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:36.650
I heard it's basketball.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:45.070
Adventure time!

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:50.460
Squad Member Baselard takes her
first step into unfamiliar territory...

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:52.740
Hup-hup-hup!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:59.340
Ah! I found something shiny!

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:03.920
Squad Member Baselard
wastes no time in finding treasure!

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:05.550
Baselard!

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.130
There you are, Base!

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:10.180
Let's hurry up and go home!

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:11.890
No thanks.

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:14.190
Turnsies!

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:24.110
See you!

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.070
Hey, wait right there!

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:27.610
We have to turn this water off.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:30.650
It'll be bad if we get wet, so be careful.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:35.920
You can do it!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:36.540
Here!

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:40.620
I'll go get it.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:41.750
Thanks.

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:46.390
Help us!

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.390
You both came too?!

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:58.140
My tummy hurts, so I'll be
going to the nurse's office now.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:02.640
That girl, I swear... What is she thinking?

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:05.610
We can't expose ourselves like that!

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.030
You're right.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:10.690
Still, it's boring just staying indoors all the time, right?

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:12.030
You're right.

00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:13.910
Just whose side are you on?!

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.500
I knew it! Frame Arms Girls!

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:22.410
Bukiko?!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.420
Wait, hold up! I've never seen these models!

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.750
I can't take it! This construction is awesome!

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:31.810
They're like 2D pictures that
have been perfectly rendered!

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:34.130
Their joints move so beautifully...

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:36.390
At 3 mm, they're perfectly interchangeable!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:39.470
Factory Advance has the greatest
techniques in the world, huh?!

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:41.390
And what's with the way they talk?

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:43.730
Tell me, what kind of program are they installed with?!

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:51.870
Seriously, I was sure you
had some F.A. Girls on you earlier.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:53.900
Th-That's impressive...

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:59.030
I, Kotobuki Bukiko, can ID the scent of model kits
even if under water or caged in by fire!

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:02.580
And believe me, when they release
a limited-edition kit, I'm the first one in line!

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:03.800
Oh, really?

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:06.260
Still, to think you got some test models...

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.830
That's just like you, Ao-dono!

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:10.220
I'm super impressed!

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:12.800
What's more, the programming in these is awesome.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:16.230
The wise hawk knows when to hide its talons, huh?

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.600
I wanna see the source code.

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:20.680
It's okay. This won't hurt...

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:23.730
It could be Base.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:24.680
Let's go!

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:27.310
Is everything okay?

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:29.570
I went to sit down when all of a sudden, my chair just...

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.950
The lead's gone from my mechanical pencil!

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:34.830
Huh? My hair clip is gone.

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:37.330
Did I lose my pin badge somewhere?

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:39.710
The handle came off my bag.

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:42.960
They said all the spoons and forks in the cafeteria went missing!

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:44.840
Where did the mirror go?

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:48.760
So, tracking down these incidents brings us <i>here.</i>

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:51.210
I wonder if Baselard's behind this.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:52.750
But why would she...?

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:54.210
Intriguing...

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:55.770
Anyway, let's go take a look!

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:58.760
Huh? She's not here.

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:07.190
Base! What are you doing?

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.810
Howdy, Ao!

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.860
Gourai and Stylet are here too huh?

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.980
School sure is fun!

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:15.940
I might start coming here every day.

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:17.400
Stop talking nonsense!

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:19.780
You're not getting rid of me!

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:22.680
I love playing catch!

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:23.860
Stop right there!
I love playing catch!

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:24.590
Stop right there!

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.830
That's enough!

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:31.330
What should we do?
Sty-ko can't handle her all alone, right?

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:33.420
Still, it's not like we can fly...

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:35.670
I have a cunning plan!

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:39.880
I swear!

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:41.970
Base, you need to cut this out!

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:43.850
Splash, mumble mumble.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:51.810
Which of these nippers did you lose,
the gold ones or these silver ones?

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:54.400
Hmm... Which was it again?

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:56.370
Or was it <i>these?</i>

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:56.810
Hailing from Hokuriku,
an area renowned for blade manufacturing,

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:56.930
<b>Single-edged Design</b>

00:07:56.930 --> 00:07:57.060
<b>Rugged Spring
Single-edged Design</b>

00:07:57.060 --> 00:07:59.200
<b>Ultra-hard,
Lightweight Body</b>

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.740
these particular nippers are famous the world over,

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:02.940
having been designed by a legendary maker of countless industrial tools

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:03.060
<b>Straight Edge</b>

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:03.190
<b>Handle
Stop</b>

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.310
<b>Soft Grip</b>

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:05.780
having been designed by a legendary maker of countless industrial tools

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:07.360
and having unparalleled durability and cutting potential.

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:07.480
<b>Easy-grip Design</b>

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:07.610
<b>Precise Adjustment</b>

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:08.840
<b>Maximum
Open Stop</b>

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:11.370
Was it these sparkling Kotobuki Nippers you lost?

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:15.260
Wow, you're right! They do sparkle!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:16.710
I know, right?

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:19.260
These Kotobuki Nippers are a
must-have for all modelers!

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:23.430
Your average human or F.A. Girl
just doesn't get how awesome they are!

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.960
They are the chosen tools, I say!

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:31.560
Um, I'd like to take a look at those...

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:34.660
Wow, this F.A. Girl <i>does</i> get the difference!

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:39.490
The main thing about these Kotobuki Nippers
is their unique, slightly curved blades.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:41.250
Ooh! Yes, indeed.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.580
Now, Gourai!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:43.500
Understood, Ao!

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:47.120
Got you!

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:50.920
That wasn't easy, huh?

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:52.920
Yeah, got that right.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:56.340
I feel like not a single good thing has happened today...

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.420
That sure was fun!

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:01.260
It wasn't fun for me at all!

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:04.140
Really? What about you, Gourai?

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:05.890
You had fun, right?

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:07.150
"Fun"?

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:10.650
Yeah! All of us playing chase and
hide-and-go-seek together!

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:13.560
Fun... I see.

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:15.900
This is "fun"!

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:17.910
Yes! It was fun!

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:22.110
It took a bit of work though.

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:26.000
Still, that was great how you knew
that Base likes sparkly things.

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:31.120
There is no mystery that Bukiko,
the famous detective, cannot solve!

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:36.630
Especially when paired with Stylet-chan's resolve,
Ao's acting, and Gourai-chan's hunting skills!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.170
That's a stretch...

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:40.630
W-well, it was a team victory.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:45.470
Something impossible on our own
becomes possible when we work together!

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:54.940
Here Come the Materia Sisters
Here Come the Materia Sisters

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:57.240
I'm home...

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.960
Welcome back, Ao.

00:09:58.960 --> 00:09:59.490
Huh?

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.470
Wait, what happened to you?!

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:08.930
Yeesh. Ao, you're filthy!

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:12.560
I was playing with some goats on the way back,
and one thing led to another...

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:15.180
That must have been some intense playing.

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:16.520
Why are you all wet?

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:17.540
Don't ask that!

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:20.740
One thing led to another, all right?!
Anyway, I'm taking a shower!

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:24.140
Oh, we got another package in the mail.

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:26.400
You can go ahead and open it.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:33.160
Do you think it's a new F.A. Girl?

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:34.380
Probably.

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:36.530
Let's hurry up and open it!

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.160
This is...

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.630
Is this the place?

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:14.200
Oh, my! You're-

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:15.830
Gourai-chan, aren't you?

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:16.690
Smooch.

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:19.370
And one for you, Stylet-chan.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:19.960
Smooch.

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:21.960
And you, Baselard-chan.

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:22.870
Smooch.

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:25.700
Pleased to meet you.

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:29.620
Oh! Some new faces!

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:32.300
You guys look alike. Are you sisters?

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:34.000
What are your names?

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:34.010
Call us "Materia."

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:35.600
We're Materia.
Call us "Materia."

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:38.010
Uh...

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:40.140
So, you're Materia?

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:42.770
And <i>you're</i> Materia?

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:47.140
You're both named "Materia"?

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:52.020
That's right. Our body frame
was the model for everyone else's.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:56.330
We two were designed together and made together.

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:58.440
So we also share the same name.

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:00.620
That's going to make things confusing.

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:02.200
It's just weird!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:05.670
Oh, dear. It hasn't been a problem up until now.

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:09.590
We don't mind if you call us both "Materia."

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:11.220
Yes, but still...

00:12:13.180 --> 00:12:14.180
White!

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:15.640
Black!

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:19.000
Otherwise, it'd be a pain,
so those are your names. Okay?

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:21.730
Ah! I'm "White"!

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:23.440
And I'm "Black."

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:26.860
It's a little embarrassing, isn't it?

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:29.010
Still, it's not all that bad.

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:31.490
They seem, like, kinda nice, huh?

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:34.780
You think so? I can't really tell.

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:36.740
Yeah, it's hard to...

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:39.660
Wait, that's not the point! We need to battle them!

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:41.530
That's why you're here, right?

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.780
Oh, dear. It totally slipped our minds.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.420
How careless of us.

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:47.740
Oh! So you're gonna battle, huh?

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.550
Yes, of course.

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:52.800
Girls like you, so new...

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:54.180
...and shiny...

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:56.270
...and cute.

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:57.510
It really...

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:58.500
...truly...

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.510
...will be a pleasure to crush you!

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:06.440
You will be destroyed oh-so-expertly.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:08.760
I'm sure it will feel wonderful.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:11.110
Pain is the ultimate pleasure, yes?

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:13.520
Be sure your screams are appropriate.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:27.070
Why did it have to be <i>me?</i>

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:32.670
Base-chan had the same "scent" about her as us.

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:38.210
If we're going to destroy someone,
a strong, yet fragile girl like you would be more fun.

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:41.850
Fine, whatever!

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:44.310
Very well. Please attach your armor.

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:47.320
No, we're fine like this.

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:49.360
After all, you won't hit us.

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:50.760
Our weapons will be...

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.180
...more than enough.

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:55.450
Stylet, are you familiar with those weapons?

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:58.200
No, I've never seen them before.

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:02.520
Whoa! Those are the Grind Circle
and Beastmaster swords!

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:06.620
I've heard they're hard to use.
These Materia girls are awesome!

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:08.170
Huh, really?

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:11.170
There is no data on those weapons.

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:13.330
It would be risky to dive in unprepared.

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:16.300
With talk like that, we'd never collect any data at all!

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:18.010
Just cover me.

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:21.600
Gourai!

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:22.640
Stylet!

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:23.680
Materia!

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:26.730
Frame Arms Girl Session...

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:28.510
Go!
Just you watch!
Here we come.
I shall crush you.

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:42.270
I'm about to get serious!

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:47.250
Smooch.

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:52.280
Come peer into our secret flower garden.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.750
I'll take White, so you take Black!

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:01.540
Stylet!

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:06.050
Welcome. We shall pamper you.

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:34.380
I can't get a lock on her!

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:35.600
Gotcha!

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:45.890
Dummy! You need to stop Black for me!

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:47.930
But you're in the line of fire.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:52.190
Oh dear, oh dear, oh dear.

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:55.140
Stylet-chan, your back is wide open!

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:57.500
You have nice legs, Gourai-chan.

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:00.320
I just want to start at the tips and carve my way up.

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:02.910
Come on, let me hear some wonderful screams.

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:07.040
What's going on? I can't hit her at all!

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:10.500
Stylet! It's clear we can't win by attacking individually!

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.660
We have to battle as a team too!

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:14.950
Just stay out of my way!

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:17.420
Oh, my. Are they having a falling out?

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:19.040
How sad.

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:21.970
Aah, I can't bear to watch this!

00:16:21.970 --> 00:16:23.550
Isn't there anything they can do?

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:26.500
It's too bad they don't get along better.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.180
There's no way they can suddenly force it!

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:30.760
Oh, wait!

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:34.010
Bukiko put together a prototype weapon! Um...

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.610
Let's see...

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:42.360
Hey there, Ao! Well, I finished it -
a new weapon for the F.A. Girls!

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:48.260
I call it, "Heavy Weapon Unit 17
Revolving Buster Cannon Prototype"!

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:52.460
Seriously, using these super awesome parts
makes even the runner inlet a work of art, right?

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:55.000
And I totally painted it up nice and perfect, amirite?

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.630
The black finish gives it a sense of weight.

00:16:57.630 --> 00:16:59.940
And check out that Panzer grey coloring!

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:02.970
Aah, it really is an awesome color. I wanna marry it!

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:05.790
I wanna be Kotobuki Panzer Grey Bukiko!

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:10.810
But it was the 5:1 mixture of rusty brown and
streaking grime that yours truly insists on

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:12.600
that gives it a realistic, oil-stained look that-

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:16.090
Anyway, this is it!

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:18.760
Wait, how do I give it to them?

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:23.480
Um, put it on Gourai's base
and then swipe it on your phone.

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:25.190
Gourai! Use this!

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:26.320
Understood!

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:33.040
This is...

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:34.620
the workmanship is incredible.

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:39.090
It's worlds apart from the crude weapons
that Ao slaps together.

00:17:39.090 --> 00:17:41.800
With this, I can win for sure!

00:17:46.180 --> 00:17:49.080
How are we supposed to hit her
when we can't even read her movements?

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:53.460
Well, we'll figure something out. Something!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.040
Fine. I'll be the decoy.

00:17:57.550 --> 00:18:00.610
No, you can't! One false move and-!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:04.200
What's impossible on our own
becomes possible when we work together, right?

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:07.730
Just make sure that you hit her.

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:09.440
Okay!

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:10.620
Here goes!

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:12.040
Oh my, oh my.

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:16.210
Begin energy charge!

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:31.970
Anything yet?!

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:33.600
Just a little longer!

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:37.730
I'll only have one chance
to take out the Materia sisters.

00:18:37.730 --> 00:18:40.430
I have to make sure it's 100% charged!

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:48.990
Going after a girl like Stylet-chan
and making her grovel is the best!

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:54.080
Sure enough, the cutest face is one that's
streaked with snot and tears.

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:55.870
Go on, cry.

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:57.070
Scream.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:59.860
Break, and then break some more.

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:02.950
Give it a rest already, you perverts.

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.970
Charging complete!

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:09.330
Stylet, get out of the way!

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:13.390
Revolving Buster Cannon - maximum output!

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:14.320
Fire!

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:18.580
Huh?

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:27.110
Winners: Gourai and Stylet.

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:34.410
Thank you, Stylet.

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:36.070
We won thanks to you.

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:40.070
You took your time charging that thing, you idiot.

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.460
They're getting along?

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:49.010
There's always a silver lining, huh?

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:52.250
Huh? You're staying?!

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:55.440
Yes. We couldn't bear to leave as losers.

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:59.000
And we have to collect data of our own.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.630
Staying here would be most efficient, don't you think?

00:20:02.150 --> 00:20:03.640
Also...

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:07.220
We've taken an interest in Stylet-chan.

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:08.060
Huh?

00:20:08.530 --> 00:20:11.700
We want to hear more - even more - of your screams.

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:15.120
Look, quit fooling around!

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:17.120
Ao, get these fools out of here!

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:21.000
Yeah, I don't think I can take in any more.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:22.580
That's too bad.

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:24.880
Having us here would lead to more battles...

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:27.710
...which would mean more money for you.

00:20:28.630 --> 00:20:32.120
I'm so happy to see our new family grow!

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:33.120
Whaaat?!

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:35.260
It's all right, Stylet-chan.

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:38.810
You'll get used to it soon. It only hurts at first.

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:44.730
That's right. Taste us once,
and your body will forever crave us.

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:50.280
Stylet, you're such a cutie.

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:54.240
C'mon, Gourai. Don't you have anything to add?

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:56.160
Um...

00:20:56.160 --> 00:21:00.410
It's no use, Stylet. This is Ao's decision.

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:02.180
That's not fair!

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:03.500
I'm leaving!

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:05.450
I'm going back to Factory Advance!

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.670
Aah, I can already smell that money!

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:14.080
They'll soon show up at your door,

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:19.480
for my special someone, parts of hearts!

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:29.760
Counting the days I can't see you,

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:37.210
I want to hear your voice so badly I feel like crying!

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:40.700
I'm new to this world,

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:44.170
so I lack the language to describe it.

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:46.440
To knockoffs, say...

00:21:46.440 --> 00:21:49.890
"No!" Take care to avoid them.

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:53.410
I want to be be dedicated!

00:21:56.800 --> 00:22:02.110
I want to build it all from nothing!

00:22:02.110 --> 00:22:05.340
We laugh and we fight,

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:08.950
creating our unique specs!

00:22:08.950 --> 00:22:14.870
By mixing love and hate,

00:22:14.870 --> 00:22:22.940
I want to create more of these funny, carefree days, the parts of Girl!

00:22:40.430 --> 00:22:41.220
White here!

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:42.240
Black here.

00:22:42.240 --> 00:22:43.960
Let's be utter sadists today as well.

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:46.720
Sadistic in the sense of, "Hurry up and get on your knees."

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:47.220
Redecorating is Fun
Redecorating is Fun
Jinrai Appears!
Jinrai Appears!

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:50.180
In the sense of, "That's hardly enough to start trembling."

00:22:50.180 --> 00:22:52.210
Next time on Frame Arms Girl,

00:22:52.210 --> 00:22:54.260
let's have a session together, okay?

00:22:54.260 --> 00:22:54.890
Jinrai Appears!
Jinrai Appears!
